{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15973","headline":"空城雀 · 王建","name":"空城雀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空城雀，何不飞来人家住？\n空城无人种禾黍，土间生子草间长。\n满地蓬蒿幸无主，近村虽有高树枝。\n雨中无食长苦饥，八月小儿挟弓箭。\n家家畏向田头飞，但能不出空城里。\n秋时百草皆有子，报言黄口莫啾啾，长尔得成无横死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}